# The Sensational She-Hulk comes down on turn 1 as the back face (Black Lotus, Mox Emerald and a Sol Ring pay the {3}{G}{W}{W}).
# On turn 2 Bot2 bolts her twice, with a Mountain and a Mox Ruby. The first time Bot1 aims the retaliation at Bot2 and declines
# the "you may": nothing is dealt, and "do this only once each turn" is spent by the doing (CR 603.2h), not by the triggering,
# so the second Bolt triggers her again and that time Bot1 accepts: Bot2 is at 17, and she dies to the 6 damage with the
# trigger already on the stack.

